SenBar - Fonts folder
=====================
Put your .ttf font files in this folder.

SenBar loads this font automatically for the "Cervo Neue" text styles
(Settings > Text > Text style):

    Fonts\CervoNeueBlack.ttf

To use another font, replace that file with your own .ttf and keep the same
file name, then type /reload in game.
If the file is missing, SenBar falls back to the default game font.

Note: check the license of any font before you publish the addon.
